<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66777" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέταλλον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mine, quarry</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλὸς μέταλλον</span> salt-<i>pit</i>,
				salt-<i>mine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.185
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τετμημένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Eux.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. παλαιὸν ἀνασάξιμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1582.56
				</span></i>
			: mostly in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρύσεα καὶ ἀργύρεα
				μέταλλα</span> gold and silver <i>mines</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.57
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀργύρεια μ.</span>, at
			Laurium, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.55
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέταλλα</span> (alone) <i>silver
				mines</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				4.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρμάρου μ.</span> marble
				<i>quarries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.1.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mine</i> in siege-operations, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιορκεῖν διὰ τῶν μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					16.11.2
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>work</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ ἐν τοῖς ἀργυρείοις [ἐστί] μοι μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later,
				<i>mineral, metal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sammelb.
				4313
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i/ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				5.3.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				11.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				5.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.363
			</span></i>. (On the etym. cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταλλάω</span>.)</div>
